WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.860
My name is Ilse Langnar.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.690
After school today, I witnessed a terrible act
by the student council president.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.030
I'm currently running towards our club room.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.990
I'm a member of the Newspaper Club.
We stand firm in the face of pressure.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.120
I'll write about his wrongdoing in this
notebook in order to make him resign.

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:18.950
I won't yield.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.500
I won't... yield!

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.510
Sawney! Don't wander off on your own.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.300
We gotta go now.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:40.430
What's that, Levi?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:45.400
This is... a record of Ilse Langnar's
achievements in battle.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.110
Then let's have Sawney deliver it to her.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:21.450
Period 10
Recommendation! Titan Junior High School

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:22.950
The Newspaper Club is pretty shrewd.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:26.000
I heard that they exposed
a scandal by the student council.

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:29.040
They're going to hold an election
for student council president?

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:34.800
Jean, are you going to run
for student council president?

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.880
Huh? Of course I am!

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:40.050
What do you think all my
achievements at school have been for?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.260
Right, Marco?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:46.640
Yeah. Working for everyone in school...
There's no greater honor than that.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.400
Hey, Marco!

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.190
Quit talkin' like a goody-two-shoes
and say what you <i>really</i> think!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.400
It's because being president means
all the girls will go crazy for you, right?

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.740
No! I really do want to—

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:59.360
Becoming the president means
that girls will want you,

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:03.200
and that means you can get comfy
and just have some fun. Am I right or what?

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.290
Hey... did you say student council president?

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:14.420
I'll become student council president
and destroy every last Titan!

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:16.130
- S-Sorry.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:16.460
- Huh?

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:18.720
What're you saying?

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.340
It's obvious that I'm gonna be the president!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:26.140
You don't need to be president to keep
that comfy fantasy in your head going!

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:27.600
- Stop it.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.940
- S-Sorry!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.650
What a pain.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.020
Hey, put me down, Mikasa!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:38.900
You always have Mikasa save your ass!
But I'm the one who'll win the election!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.410
I didn't realize how committed
Jean is to winning the election.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.950
You bastard! I'm jealous!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.080
Dammit... This is crazy.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.170
Betting on beetle sumo matches
in the student council room...

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:56.500
Indeed, the corruption went
far beyond our wildest imaginations.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:04:01.260
That's why I chose to join,
but we've got extra work now.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.220
I joined the student council
to reform it, and yet...

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:09.560
Really? Wow, you're that kind of guy, Marlo?
Should I recommend you?

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.810
I'm not saying that because
I want to become president.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.610
Hey, why don't you say something, too, Annie?

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.650
She's sleeping?!
She looks scary when she's sleeping!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.360
I'm gonna run for president!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.860
We got ourselves a weirdo...

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:22.570
Then please sign here.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:23.630
<b>Name
Year   Class
I will run for
student council president</b>

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.120
Then please sign here.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:27.990
My autograph? Oh, I see...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.410
So you like me, huh?

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:35.130
Well, I guess I could at least
exchange email addre—

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:37.460
You damn horse face!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.420
Oh? Marco, where's Jean?

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.760
Well, he was taken to the nurse's office.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.100
So I'm on my way to pick up his posters for him.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.310
Huh?! You need posters?

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.480
Eren! We can make one at my place,
so let's hurry home.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.270
All right!

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.810
Thanks, Marco!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.150
Maybe this layout would do, huh?

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:56.400
That's amazing, Armin! You're like a pro!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.940
<b>I'll destroy
the Titans
Eren Jaeger</b>

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.860
That's amazing, Armin! You're like a pro!

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.570
This isn't that hard. To tell you the truth...

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.320
...you can even make changes to your face.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:08.620
Seriously?! Then make me super cool looking.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:08.660
<b>I'll destroy
the Titans
Eren Jaeger
Seriously?! Then make me super cool looking.</b>

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:08.870
Eren Jaeger
<b>I'll destroy
the Titans</b>

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.200
Sure, leave it to me!
Just move this over here...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:11.410
Eren Jaeger
<b>I'll destroy
the Titans</b>

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:14.170
Whoa! Then make this and that like these...

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.080
Yep, yep...

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.710
And make that part all sharp like bang! And boom!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:19.500
I see.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:19.750
All right! This looks super cool!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.470
<b>I'll destroy
the Titans
Eren Jaeger
All right! This looks super cool!</b>

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.630
Huh?

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.590
Eren... Are you serious
about putting this poster up?

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.720
This poster will get me elected for sure!
You think so, too, don't you, Mikasa?!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.190
Mikasa, tell him what you're really thinking!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.150
I think... it turned out good.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.900
Whaaaat?!

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.360
In any case, this is really cool.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.570
Hey, Eren, are you really gonna put this up?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.660
This is sure to get me elected!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.160
Hi, Eren.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.580
Marco!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.370
Looks like you got your posters, huh?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.790
You came to put yours up, too?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.120
<b>Oruo Bozad
Don't get cocky,
rookie.</b>

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.500
What the hell is this?!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.840
Hey, hey, are you still
working on putting up your posters?

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:01.710
Oruo!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.630
Don't tell me this poster is...

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:04.840
Of course it's me.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.760
That's a totally different person!

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.390
More importantly, can you afford
to be wasting time like this?

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:14.140
This bulletin board is filled
head-to-toe with posters of me.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:17.350
The other bulletin boards
are already filled, too.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:22.110
There's no place left for you guys!

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.150
What do I do?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.110
If you can't figure out what to do,
you won't be able to become presi—

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.240
I got it!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:29.740
We can put it up on top of his!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.410
Hey!

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.830
The results of the opinion poll are out!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:37.920
Wh-Why?!

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.460
In a way, a zero percent approval rate
is quite an accomplishment.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.250
Huh, I've never seen anyone
actually get zero percent before.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.210
Shut u—

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.220
Oh, Hange!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.220
Don't make a racket in the hallway, brats.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:51.100
Dammit! Isn't there a way
to quickly turn things around?!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.680
There may be...

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.020
The one who exposed
the student council's scandal

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:58.270
is a student in the Newspaper Club named Ilse.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:03.320
I heard that everything about this school
is written down in her notebook.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:04.940
Such an incredible notebook actually exists?!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.820
Has anyone seen it?

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.490
You have, right, Levi?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:09.490
Yeah...

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:14.540
Her notebook indeed had info that
all the students would be dying to know.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.540
In other words, if I can just obtain
that notebook, I could turn things around...

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.620
<b>Approval Rate Interim Results</b>

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.630
Yeah, I think that's a possibility.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:20.830
<b>Approval Rate Interim Results</b>

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.460
Marco! Let's go to the Newspaper Club!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:22.500
<b>Approval Rate Interim Results</b>

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.750
What? Hold on a sec!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.880
I won't be outdone! I'll get the notebook!

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.630
We're going, too, Bertholdt!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:29.550
Okay!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.140
Don't run in the hallway, brats!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.390
I promise that if I become
student council president,

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:35.890
Rico

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:36.640
I'll make every effort to
further clean the wall surface!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.520
<b>Rico</b>

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.980
Rico Brzenska...

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:43.570
She's running for president to increase
the budget for the Wall Cleanup Club,

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.940
as well as to promote school cleaning
among the regular students.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:46.990
There she is!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:51.410
They're candidates...
Eren Jaeger and Jean Kirschtein!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.660
Give me your notebook!

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:56.290
Huh? What?! What's he saying?!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:57.040
What?!

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.710
That notebook's gonna be ours!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.170
Wh-What's going on?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.420
Give me the notebook!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.800
I'm the one who'll be president!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.590
<b>Rico</b>

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.840
Hold it!

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.930
What's with these people?!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.010
I can't catch up with her like this!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.310
I'm the one who'll be president!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.560
<b>My name is
Ilse Langnar.</b>

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.810
My name is Ilse Langnar.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.060
While gathering information,

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:29.190
I started being chased by
election candidates for some reason!

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.410
My return to the club room
and survival seem virtually impossible.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:37.290
But... I might be able to reach
the club room without running into them.

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:42.080
That's right. What I should do now
is not prostrate myself before fear.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.710
I won't yield.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.210
I won't... yield!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.340
I got it!

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:48.710
Thanks, Jean!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:49.590
Conny!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:50.050
- A stupid-looking monkey and a horse face are closing in on me.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.720
- I was right about following you!

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.140
- Dammit! You play dirty!
- I'm about to meet my end. This is it.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.640
I did it!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:58.390
Sasha!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.720
My notebook!

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.560
You're playing dirty, you thieves!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.350
I didn't expect you to be so naive, Jean.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.650
Do you need manners when stealing
someone's prize? Let's see...

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:08.860
<b>Student Handbook</b>

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.070
Th-This is...!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:10.110
<b>Student Handbook</b>

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.650
I got it!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:12.740
Run, Bertholdt!

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:13.450
Yep!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:14.610
Stop!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.160
My notebook!

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.410
Dammit!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.410
Do you have a stomachache or something?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.210
I've learned something that's truly shocking...

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:25.080
I can now make my wishes come true!

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:29.590
The school shop gets more <i>yakisoba</i> bread
on Wednesday than other days!

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.550
Are you serious?!

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:32.760
Where's everyone?

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.010
Hurry up, Bertholdt!

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:34.630
Yep.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:35.590
Hold it, bastards!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.760
My notebook!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.260
Dammit!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.600
Mikasa!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.810
Reiner! Mikasa's coming!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:44.560
<b>Attack Junior High School
Student Handbook</b>

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.770
Go! Eren!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.070
Out of my way!

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:56.110
Eren!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.910
It's not fair to use the gear!

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.910
This is for the sake of the Wall Cleanup Club.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.660
Just as I thought...

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:09.790
...there is no secret weapon
for becoming student council president.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:14.010
What's written in here are tips
on how to clean the school.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:18.180
It's true that this is information
Levi would be dying to know.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:20.310
What the hell?!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:24.680
What in the hell's your problem?!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:25.310
I'm sorry.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:26.230
<b>Student Handbook
Attack Junior High School</b>

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.190
What's wrong with them?!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.020
They're all nice guys,

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:34.070
but they're sort of impulsive,
or perhaps I should say they're too honest.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.820
But...

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:41.160
...I think anyone in that group
would be a good student council president.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:44.290
It's been a fierce election battle

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.210
due to an unexpectedly large
number of candidates,

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.130
but now it's time to hear their final speeches.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:53.250
Who will get the honor of being
the next student council president

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.760
of Attack Junior High School?!

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:56.220
<b>Attack Junior High School Student Council President Election
Press Section</b>

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:56.420
<b>Press Section
Attack Junior High School Student Council President Election</b>

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.510
Rico Brzenska is our first speaker!

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.890
If I become student council president,

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.810
in order to further clean the school,
I'll force all the students

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:09.020
to clean during each break,
do a big cleanup after school,

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:12.110
and volunteer for cleaning on non-school days!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.030
Boo!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.360
Why?!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.070
- Oh? Not bad...

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.160
- There's already a great deal of turmoil in this election!

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.830
Next is Reiner Braun!

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.700
If I become student council president...

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:30.540
...I'll aggressively hold training camps
and swimming meets

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.670
in order to increase the
opportunities for physical contact!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:35.670
Boo!

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.630
Yeah!

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:41.550
That's so low!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.470
Wha—!

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.810
It seems Reiner's withdrawing due to shock.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:49.440
Our next speaker is Oruo Bozad!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:55.690
Next is Eren Jaeger!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.360
Eren, don't say anything weird.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.450
Don't worry!

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.490
My reason for running for president is

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:08.080
that I wanna destroy all the Titans at school...

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.750
...no, in the whole world!

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:15.290
What an idiot. He dug his own grave.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.840
- There's no way you can do it!
- Boo!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:19.590
Oh, no!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.470
Wh-Why?

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.430
I gotta do something!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.850
Armin!

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:30.640
I haven't collected my thoughts yet,
but I'll do this!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.270
I'll have to think as I talk!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.780
He is <i>not</i> an enemy of humanity!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:42.030
If we combine his conviction with
the student council's remaining authority,

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.700
restoring mankind's right
will no longer be a dream!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:49.000
Does that mean that we won't
have to lose our lunch to the Titans?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.620
That can't be possi—

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.250
For Attack Junior High's glory,

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.380
in what little time I have left to live,

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:59.710
I will continue to advocate his strategic value!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.890
Did he possibly turn the battle in their favor?

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.520
I shouldn't speak anymore.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:13.560
No, I'll say it! I'll say
everything that I'm thinking!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.520
You... cowards...

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:21.360
Just shut up... and vote for me!

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.490
Wh-What's he saying?!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:28.580
Eren!

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:31.500
Is that how you ask people for a favor?

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:37.590
W-Well, the next speaker is the last one.
Jean Kirschtein!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.420
There's been a series of disappointing speeches

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:43.510
and people's expectations
are at rock bottom now.

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:46.090
Now's my chance to become president!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:52.310
I... wanna become president
so that girls will like me!

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:54.440
That's all.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.020
Boo!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.610
Why?!

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:03.860
Everyone's regretting it now.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:08.530
Had we known the hell we'd be subjected to,
we would never have run.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:13.200
Now that we're utterly exhausted,
that's all we can think about.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.790
I hope you don't get upset
at what I'm going to say.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:23.920
Jean isn't a strong person,
so he knows what it's like to be weak.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.090
I think you would feel
more comfortable with someone

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.010
who can understand your point of view,

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:31.430
even when what they ask of you is difficult.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:35.230
His decisions have been right all this time.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:39.400
So, I recommend Jean
to be student council president.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.400
His name is Marco Bodt.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:47.240
By doing the right thing without
being influenced by personal feelings,

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:50.700
he himself stands on the front lines
in order to save his friend from a crisis!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:58.080
He is indeed fit to be president!

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.790
"Results for Student Council President Election"
"Marco - Tons"

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:05.090
"Tons"

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:06.010
Congratulations
to Marco Bodt on
becoming the
new student
council president!

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:07.970
How could this happen?!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:08.300
- Dammit!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.590
- Marco outdid me!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.050
- I should be president!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:14.520
- I wanna be popular among girls!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.980
School festival...

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:48.280
"104th Attack Junior High Festival"

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:49.860
The snack stand alley is bustling.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:50.570
Cheeseburgers

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.360
In the midst of that,
Eren devotes himself to chee-burgs.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:56.990
Awed by his spirit, Armin is prepared
to give up something precious to him.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:00.000
Clear and Sunny! Titan Junior High School
